        "prompt": "A single live-action wide shot inside a small depot dispatch office in soft daylight. The open blue street door is at frame left. Eli, the man in <Picture 1>, wears a rust work jacket, cream shirt and dark trousers. He is already stepping through the doorway. He walks steadily from left to right across the worn floor toward Mara's desk. The door swings shut behind him. Mara, the woman in <Picture 2>, wears glasses and a teal blouse. She remains seated behind the wooden desk at frame right, looking up from her paperwork as he approaches. The camera gently follows his movement to the right, retaining the view of the desk and both actors. He comes to a natural stop on the left side of her desk and looks at her. Two people, natural footfalls, quiet mouths."
      },
      "employee": {
        "seed": 5013,
        "cast": [
          "employee"
        ],
        "photo_frames": [
          0,
          51
        ],
        "prompt": "Locked tripod shot. A solo photographic head-and-shoulders portrait of Eli from <Picture 1> in his rust jacket and cream shirt. His face stays centered against the same empty softly blurred blue glass door. His gaze is just to camera right. For the first two and a quarter seconds his lips rest gently together as he listens and blinks. When the recorded voice starts, he speaks in time with it: \"{line}\" His expression is understated, the words land naturally and his eyes stay on the same point. The composition holds just his face and the empty background through the entire take."
      },
