          0.065,
          0.68,
          0.68
        ],
        "prompt": "One continuous photographic reverse close-up of Mara from <Picture 1>, a Black office manager with short natural hair, glasses and a teal blouse. She is seated at her desk, looking toward screen left at the man off camera. In the daylight from the blinds, she listens quietly with closed lips for the first second and a half. Then she says in the provided voice, \"{line}\" She articulates both short phrases, closes her mouth and holds his gaze with a small nod. Locked camera, softly blurred office in back. Only the woman is visible."
      },
      "departure": {
        "seed": 5005,
        "cast": [
          "employee",
          "manager"
        ],
        "prompt": "A single live-action wide shot in the same daylight dispatch office. Eli from <Picture 1> stands beside the left end of the desk, facing Mara from <Picture 2>, who sits to the right behind it. His jacket is rust, her blouse teal. Eli finishes listening, turns his back to Mara and walks left across the floor toward the blue glass-paneled door on the far left. He reaches the handle, opens the door, and steps through into daylight. Mara stays seated behind the desk and follows him with her eyes. The camera holds the wide view of both people and the door; their movement tells the story. Both remain silent."
      },
      "street": {
        "seed": 5006,
        "cast": [
          "employee"
        ],
        "prompt": "A single live-action exterior shot in soft daylight outside the dispatch depot. The same man as <Picture 1>, in a rust jacket and dark trousers, is already walking left at an ordinary steady pace along the pavement as the shot begins. The open blue office door is behind him on the right. He continues away from the door toward the far left down the block, gradually getting smaller. The camera watches from a fixed position. Natural alternating strides and arm swing continue through the end of the shot. The storefront and pavement remain stationary, the street is otherwise empty and quiet."
      }
    }
